*   **Etherium-Horn Sorcerer ({4}{U}{R})**: Costs 6 mana, so I can't cast it yet.\n\
\n\
The most impactful play for this turn is to play the Mountain to maximize my mana, then cast **Rite of the Raging Storm**. This puts a powerful, recurring threat on the board immediately, putting pressure on my opponents.\n\
