If I steal their `Hoard-Smelter Dragon` (5/5) with `Word of Seizing`, it gets haste. Can I declare it as an attacker *after* the Declare Attackers step? No. Creatures can only be declared as attackers during the Declare Attackers step. The stack is currently in the Declare Attackers step, but past the point of *initial* declaration.\n\
