\n\
I made a crucial mistake in my attack declaration earlier. I need to recover.\n\
\n\
Given the situation, and to maximize my win rate:\n\
1.  **Let `Return to Nature` resolve.** Losing a mana rock is acceptable over wasting a potent counterspell for another opponent.\n\
